<p align="left"><b><font size="3">But I can't update when you kill all the time!</font><br>
</b><font size="1" color="#736459">March 11. 2003 - by Njall</font><b><font size="3">&nbsp;</font>
</b>
<p align="center"><img border="0" src="Quotes/197.jpg" width="420" height="26"></p>
<p align="left">So what have we been doing since last update? Hmmm, well Dain a
couple of times, Sontalak once or twice, couple of tower bosses in BoT and so
on, nothing really worth mentioning... OHHH and we also killed</p>
<p align="center"><font size="6"><b>AERIN'DAR!</b></font></p>
<p align="center"><a href="Kills/AerinDar.jpg" target="_blank"><img border="0" src="Kills/AerinDarsmall.jpg" width="512" height="384"></a></p>
<p align="center">I know, not the best of pics. But hey, it's dead!</p>
<p align="center"><img border="0" src="Kills/AerinDarloot.jpg" width="116" height="255"></p>
<p align="center"><img border="0" src="Quotes/198.jpg" width="365" height="13"></p>
<p align="center">Grats Darksphere, way nice kill!</p>
<p align="center">Grats Korisa on</p>
<p align="center"><img border="0" src="Loot/RingofNobility.jpg" width="465" height="225"><br>
<img border="0" src="Quotes/207.jpg" width="248" height="14"></p>
<p align="center">Yentihw on</p>
<p align="center"><img border="0" src="Loot/ShoulderpadsoftheVisionary.jpg" width="466" height="225"></p>
<p align="center">&nbsp;</p>
<p align="center"><img border="0" src="HoH.jpg" width="588" height="354"></p>
<p align="center">See you all in the Halls of Honor!</p>
<p align="left">Clouded in that nights event, some of you might remember our
kill in PoS :P After a long time, we finally got around to take one of these
down.</p>
<p align="center"><a href="Kills/Neffiken.jpg" target="_blank"><img border="0" src="Kills/Neffikensmall.jpg" width="512" height="384"></a></p>
<p align="center">leet</p>
<p align="center"><img border="0" src="Kills/Neffikenloot.jpg" width="116" height="206"><br>
<img border="0" src="Quotes/199.jpg" width="175" height="13"></p>
<p align="center">Bleh :P</p>
<p align="center">Grats Dlandridel on</p>
<p align="center"><img border="0" src="Loot/DirkoftheRavengingWind.jpg" width="465" height="225"></p>
<p align="center">Stay tuned, 2 others going down soon!</p>
<p align="left">Also took down The Itraer Vius again, a fun fight, easy tho.</p>
<p align="center"><img border="0" src="Kills/IVloot.jpg" width="116" height="167"></p>
<p align="center">Grats Terakkan on</p>
<p align="center"><img border="0" src="Loot/LightWoodmansBlade.jpg" width="466" height="225"></p>
<p align="center">Bragnar on</p>
<p align="center"><img border="0" src="Loot/VexXiVius.jpg" width="467" height="225"></p>
<p align="left"><b>Quotes!</b></p>
<p align="left">Hellooeeee Yent! Welcome to the Quotes section :D</p>
<p align="left"><img border="0" src="Quotes/200.jpg" width="160" height="12"></p>
<p align="left">And a few from the Cadence Mansion (Dlands fun house..)</p>
<p align="left"><img border="0" src="Quotes/201.jpg" width="418" height="40"></p>
<p align="left"><img border="0" src="Quotes/202.jpg" width="430" height="40"></p>
<p align="left"><img border="0" src="Quotes/203.jpg" width="434" height="26"></p>
<p align="left">This makes Vikos seem less.. ya know :P</p>
<p align="left">But after Fabbas commented his panties, I think he takes the
lead.</p>
<p align="left"><img border="0" src="Quotes/204.jpg" width="293" height="14"></p>
<p align="left"><img border="0" src="Quotes/205.jpg" width="420" height="27"></p>
<p align="left">Brag is still close behind :D</p>
<p align="left"><img border="0" src="Quotes/206.jpg" width="255" height="14"></p>
<p align="left">Then we asked Vikos for his comment on all the recent events,
his comment was...</p>
<p align="left"><img border="0" src="Quotes/208.jpg" width="102" height="25"></p>
<p align="left">intelligent yea..</p>
<p align="left"><img border="0" src="Quotes/209.jpg" width="417" height="26"></p>
<p align="left">Let's just end this before these kids hurt themself :D</p>
<p align="left">Untill next time!</p>


